market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>在华尔街后期复苏将纳斯达克100指数从熊市边缘拉出来之后，亚洲股市似乎有望小幅上涨，同时对人工智能交易可持续性的持续担忧提振了美国国债。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Global Stocks Climb as AI Trade Mounts a Comeback: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:10:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>特朗普通过削弱“中国+1”的关税激怒贸易伙伴</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/trump-riles-trade-partners-with-tariffs-that-undercut-china-1</link><description>唐纳德·特朗普总统最新的关税举措可能会削弱自美中贸易战开始以来全球制造业的标志性转变之一：供应链移出中国。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/trump-riles-trade-partners-with-tariffs-that-undercut-china-1'&gt;特朗普通过削弱“中国+1”的关税激怒贸易伙伴&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Trump’s Tariffs Blunt Appeal of Moving Production Out of China&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/trump-riles-trade-partners-with-tariffs-that-undercut-china-1</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:05:24 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>裕信银行扫清了接管德国商业银行的最后障碍</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/unicredit-clears-final-hurdle-to-take-over-commerzbank-video</link><description>联合信贷银行扫清了控制德国商业银行的最后监管障碍，并计划提名其首席执行官安德里亚·奥塞尔（Andrea Orcel）担任德国银行监事会主席。彭博社的史蒂文·阿伦斯报道。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/unicredit-clears-final-hurdle-to-take-over-commerzbank-video'&gt;裕信银行扫清了接管德国商业银行的最后障碍&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：UniCredit Clears Final Hurdle to Take Over Commerzbank&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/unicredit-clears-final-hurdle-to-take-over-commerzbank-video</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:50:20 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>